msgid "home.title"
msgstr "Dulno"
msgid "home.headline"
msgstr "Home"
msgid "home.slogan"
msgstr "Your digital stamp card"
msgid "home.description.1"
msgstr "Digital stamp cards make customer loyalty easier than ever before."
msgid "home.description.2"
msgstr "Discover how you can win loyal regular customers and save time at the same time."
msgid "home.try"
msgstr "Become a partner now"
msgid "home.functionality.headline"
msgstr "Functionality"
msgid "home.functionality.slogan"
msgstr "This is how Dulno works"
msgid "home.functionality.description"
msgstr "We show you how to get started with digital stamp collecting."
msgid "home.functionality.step.1.headline"
msgstr "Download"
msgid "home.functionality.step.1.description"
msgstr "Download the Dulno app to the device of your choice. Your stamp cards are managed in the app."
msgid "home.functionality.step.2.headline"
msgstr "Stamp"
msgid "home.functionality.step.2.description"
msgstr "Hold your smartphone up to the Dulno stamp to collect your point. This process only takes a few seconds."
msgid "home.functionality.step.3.headline"
msgstr "Collect"
msgid "home.functionality.step.3.description"
msgstr "Keep track of your stamp cards so you can always find them in one place and never forget them again."
msgid "home.advantages.headline"
msgstr "Advantages"
msgid "home.advantages.slogan"
msgstr "The advantages of digital stamp cards"
msgid "home.advantages.description"
msgstr "There are many advantages to digitizing your stamp cards. <br>Here are some of the advantages."
msgid "home.advantages.forgot.headline"
msgstr "Forgetfulness"
msgid "home.advantages.forgot.description"
msgstr "Never forget your stamp card again. Securely stored on your smartphone and available at any time."
msgid "home.advantages.overview.headline"
msgstr "Overview"
msgid "home.advantages.overview.description"
msgstr "You have all your cards in one place and can check the current status of your cards at any time."
msgid "home.advantages.comfort.headline"
msgstr "Comfort"
msgid "home.advantages.comfort.description"
msgstr "You no longer have to carry all your cards around with you, but can access them easily via the Dulno app."
msgid "home.advantages.environment.headline"
msgstr "Environment"
msgid "home.advantages.environment.description"
msgstr "Dozens of paper cards no longer need to be printed and distributed. These are simply generated digitally as required."
msgid "home.advantages.loyalty.headline"
msgstr "Loyalty"
msgid "home.advantages.loyalty.description"
msgstr "Increase the loyalty of your customers to you by sending them regular notifications with news and thus increasing their activity with you."
msgid "home.advantages.analytics.headline"
msgstr "Analytics"
msgid "home.advantages.analytics.description"
msgstr "Gain a deeper insight into your customers and understand their behavior better in order to retain them in the long term."
msgid "home.portal.headline"
msgstr "Portal"
msgid "home.portal.slogan"
msgstr "How to manage your business"
msgid "home.portal.description"
msgstr "Our customer portal offers you various options for managing your stamp cards and <br>strengthening customer loyalty to your business."
msgid "home.portal.cards"
msgstr "Manage cards"
msgid "home.portal.stamps"
msgstr "Assign stamps"
msgid "home.portal.analysis"
msgstr "Perform analyses"
msgid "home.portal.balances"
msgstr "Simplify accounting"
msgid "home.portal.coupons"
msgstr "Distribute coupons"
msgid "home.portal.campaigns"
msgstr "Trigger campaigns"
msgid "home.pricing.headline"
msgstr "Pricing"
msgid "home.pricing.slogan"
msgstr "Our offers for you"
msgid "home.pricing.description"
msgstr "Our users pay nothing at all for using the app. <br>We license our partners so that they can offer their stamp cards via Dulno."
msgid "home.download.headline"
msgstr "Download"
msgid "home.download.slogan"
msgstr "Download the Dulno app now"
msgid "home.download.description"
msgstr "The Dulno app is available in both the Google Play Store and the Apple Store"
